        },
        "brief": {
          "cover": "https://bbs.hycdn.cn/image/common/20260412/4826366/69db0f09a33c3e082ac5e450_56331367.png",
          "name": " 庄方宜-前瞻",
          "description": {
            "id": "document-id",
            "blockIds": [
              "ChK5cp8aAKy7",
              "Y8ASOVCw8i2C",
              "hc6LVqTQar6S",
              "UHK2SihfpGmw",
              "yUB7eGh19RUJ"
            ],
            "blockMap": {
              "ChK5cp8aAKy7": {
                "id": "ChK5cp8aAKy7",
                "parentId": "document-id",
                "align": "left",
                "kind": "text",
                "text": {
                  "inlineElements": [
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "text": {
                        "text": "“能咬牙坚持下来，就不算输。”"
                      }
                    }
                  ],
                  "kind": "body"
                }
              },
              "UHK2SihfpGmw": {
                "id": "UHK2SihfpGmw",
                "parentId": "document-id",
                "align": "left",
                "kind": "text",
                "text": {
                  "inlineElements": [
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "text": {
                        "text": "临危受命，她很快振作起来，不仅在短短十年间建设起繁荣的武陵城，她本人也在摸索中成为了一名尽职尽责的领袖。但十年前的灾难仍是悬在众人头顶的一把剑，时刻提醒着她，武陵城的安居乐业可能会转瞬即逝。"
                      }
                    }
                  ],
                  "kind": "body"
                }
              },
              "Y8ASOVCw8i2C": {
                "id": "Y8ASOVCw8i2C",
                "parentId": "document-id",
                "align": "left",
                "kind": "text",
                "text": {
                  "inlineElements": [
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "text": {
                        "text": "干员庄方宜，武陵科学发展区管代，息壤新材项目负责天师。经宏科院推荐加入终末地，进行裂隙相关的研究。"
                      }
                    }
                  ],
                  "kind": "body"
                }
              },
              "hc6LVqTQar6S": {
                "id": "hc6LVqTQar6S",
                "parentId": "document-id",
                "align": "left",
                "kind": "text",
                "text": {
                  "inlineElements": [
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "text": {
                        "text": "庄方宜出身宏山，自幼便展现出非凡天赋，未成年就以优异成绩进入天师府学院。其后因才能卓越被选拔加入息壤项目，成为武陵科考站最年轻的成员。一场灾难中，科考站几乎全军覆没，资历最浅的她被推上台前，担任管代职位，背负起整个武陵。"
                      }
                    }
                  ],
                  "kind": "body"
                }
              },
              "yUB7eGh19RUJ": {
                "id": "yUB7eGh19RUJ",
                "parentId": "document-id",
                "align": "left",
                "kind": "text",
                "text": {
                  "inlineElements": [
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "text": {
                        "text": "“人还在，那就什么都在。”"
                      }
                    }
                  ],
                  "kind": "body"
                }
              }
            },
